p=ROOT/'proposal.html';s=p.read_text()
update='''<section class="upgrade-status"><p class="eyebrow">The planning upgrade</p><h2>A complete path<br><em>from browsing to a brief.</em></h2><div class="guidance-grid"><article><h3>Built and ready to explore</h3><p>Wedding and pre-wedding routes, 40 searchable answers, four sourced location guides, a complete-cost worksheet, family-photo and preparation checklists, a schedule calculator, a gallery shortlist and a structured enquiry handoff.</p></article><article><h3>Kept honest</h3><p>Reference package prices retain their date. Unknown gallery quantities, current terms, crew and delivery milestones are clearly identified. Complete galleries, team biographies and client reviews are not invented.</p></article><article><h3>Supply before an official launch</h3><p>Approve current prices, total JPEG and retouched counts, film scope, album copies, hours, team, delivery and revision milestones, payment/rescheduling terms, privacy choices and backup arrangements. Supply actual team portraits, verified reviews and permission-cleared full galleries.</p></article></div><p class="small-note">Planning choices and saved looks are kept in this browser tab only after an explicit save action. Contact details are not stored. The visitor reviews the final WhatsApp message before choosing to send it.</p></section>'''
